    "text": "<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image2-6907d623-e745-45ad-a132-9d1bcb8e39b4.jpg\" /><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi><mo>-</mo></math>Charge density of the cube<br /><br /><math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>-</mo></math> Potential at the corner of a cube of side <math><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></math><br /><br /><math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>-</mo></math> Potential at the centre of a cube of side <math><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></math><br /><br /><math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>-</mo></math> Potential at the center of a cube of side <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>-</mo></math> Potential at the corner of a cube of side <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />By dimensional analysis<br /><br /><math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>∝</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></msubsup></math><br /><br />But by superposition <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></msubsup></math><br /><br />Because of the centre of the larger cube lies at a corner of the eight smaller cubes of which it is made<br /><br />Therefore, <math><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
